\newlabel{fig:zenocrn}{{3}{18}{The simulated expected value of $|X_n-X'_n|$ where $X_n,X'_n$ follow Zeno's walk and are simulated using CRN. The CRN estimate uses the mean of $1000$ simulations. $X_0=0,X'_0=100$. Since CRN is an optimal coupling (Lemma \ref {lem:zeno}), the simulations are unbiased estimates of the actual convergence rates}{figure.3}{}}
